Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 04:05:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Show breakfast/lunch/dinner menus based on system time

Breakfast 7:00-10:30, lunch 10:30-16:30, dinner 16:30-22:00. The menu
re-checks the clock every 30s so it switches at boundaries, shows a
"now serving" status, and falls back to breakfast with a closed notice
outside serving hours. Also registers the missing /api/menus routes
that DiningMenu fetches from.

